  ; ⚠️ FMLA and FMLS are FUSED: one rounding for the multiply and the add
  ; together, which is why they are not an `fmul` followed by an `fadd` and
  ; why `rd` is an operand rather than a destination the backend fills in.
  ; FMLS negates the multiplicand rather than the product -- the same value,
  ; and the spelling the architecture uses.

