  ; ⚠️ The index is an OPERAND, so a broadcast cannot be a constant lane read.
  ; `(lane rm k)` folds while the vector expands and needs `k` known then; the
  ; instruction only knows it at run time. So each of these is a select over
  ; the four lanes the index can name, with the lane read constant inside each
  ; arm -- the same shape `size` already takes throughout this file, and the
  ; reason a two-bit field costs four expansions rather than one.

  (definstruction mla_elem_v
